WEBVTT

00:06.250 --> 00:07.460
<b>Okay!</b>

00:07.460 --> 00:11.130
<b>Yeah, that's looking good. Right on point.</b>

00:10.830 --> 00:14.040
<b>HS 2nd Year                                                                                 HS 2nd Year
Shiho Kunieda                                                                            Kanon Kougami</b>

00:13.210 --> 00:15.920
<b>Just when I thought we'd finally 
finished up the last tour,</b>

00:15.920 --> 00:18.250
<b>here we go playing at schools nationwide.</b>

00:18.750 --> 00:23.330
<b>And then here you are, back and prepping
before any of the staff.</b>

00:23.330 --> 00:26.000
<b>I'm glad you're really into this but,
how are you holding up?</b>

00:26.000 --> 00:28.330
<b>Oh this is nothing.</b>

00:28.580 --> 00:34.790
<b>Plus, we'll be finishing up right where we wanted,
at Shinjugamine Girls' School.</b>

00:34.790 --> 00:38.210
<b>Can't go slipping up in 
front of them now can we?</b>

00:35.750 --> 00:38.420
<b>Fortissimo</b>

00:40.750 --> 00:42.920
<b>We've got a new song to reveal, too.</b>

00:43.130 --> 00:46.170
<b>Yeah, so let's make this a show to remember!</b>

00:46.170 --> 00:47.880
<b>You got it, Kanon!</b>

00:52.630 --> 00:53.750
<b>What?!</b>

00:56.790 --> 00:58.000
<b>Hoshimori.</b>

00:58.000 --> 01:01.170
<b>Donning their celestial suits with
the power of the Holy Tree,</b>

01:01.170 --> 01:06.040
<b>they stand as humanity's only hope
against the mysterious Irous invaders.</b>

01:06.790 --> 01:11.880
<b>And this, this is the story of both
their battles and their comradery.</b>

01:15.790 --> 01:21.830
<b>Ima meippai no hoshizora ni 
yume no seiza o mitsukeyou</b>

01:21.830 --> 01:30.250
<b>Kokoro o tsunaidara itsuka kanaeru yo</b>

01:38.540 --> 01:43.500
<b>Hashiridasu junbi wa dekita ka na</b>

01:43.960 --> 01:49.080
<b>Nagai michi demo nakama ga iru kara</b>

01:49.500 --> 01:53.790
<b>Fuange na kao shite mayou yori</b>

01:53.790 --> 01:58.710
<b>Tobikonde waraou</b>

01:59.290 --> 02:04.750
<b>Surechigai de kousa shita heart mo</b>

02:04.750 --> 02:07.460
<b>Kizuna e to kawaru desho</b>

02:07.460 --> 02:14.580
<b>Kasanetara hitotsu ni shite 
mirai o tsukamu chikara ni</b>

02:15.250 --> 02:21.080
<b>Ima meippai no hoshizora 
e yume o zutto oikakete</b>

02:21.080 --> 02:26.540
<b>Nobashita tenohira wa 
akiramenai omoi o kureru</b>

02:26.540 --> 02:32.040
<b>Nanbyaku kai no chousen mo 
hitori nanka ja nai kara</b>

02:32.040 --> 02:39.040
<b>Daijoubu kao o agete kitto starry sky</b>

02:39.040 --> 02:41.880
<b>Kanaeru yo</b>

02:44.080 --> 02:49.040
<b>Episode 4
Songs with Emotion</b>

02:54.040 --> 02:58.040
<b>Please let the Fortissimo 
concert be a great hit...</b>

02:58.500 --> 03:00.630
<b>Okay! Now we're good to go!</b>

03:00.750 --> 03:03.250
<b>Just because we got tickets...</b>

03:00.750 --> 03:04.630
<b>HS 1st Year                                                 HS 1st Year
Subaru Wakaba                                         Haruka Narumi</b>

03:03.250 --> 03:05.500
<b>Coming out here to give a prayer for them,</b>

03:05.500 --> 03:06.670
<b>it's so Miki of you, Miki.</b>

03:06.670 --> 03:10.500
<b>JH 3rd Year
Kokomi Asahina                                                                                                        JH 3rd Year
Urara Hasumi</b>

03:06.670 --> 03:11.290
<b>It's got me wondering though, was Kokomi's
family's shrine here one for a god of entertainment?</b>

03:11.290 --> 03:14.960
<b>I don't think so...</b>

03:15.130 --> 03:18.210
<b>Hey, why don't we all draw fortunes! C'mon!</b>

03:15.130 --> 03:18.500
<b>HS 1st Year
Miki Hoshitsuki</b>

03:19.830 --> 03:23.080
<b>Can't stop a rolling stone, now can you?</b>

03:24.960 --> 03:26.920
<b>Fortunes
100 Yen</b>

03:25.380 --> 03:26.920
<b>Sweet! How lucky!</b>

03:26.920 --> 03:28.330
<b>"Great Luck!"</b>

03:28.330 --> 03:29.880
<b>I got "Good Luck."</b>

03:29.880 --> 03:31.330
<b>What about you, Urara?</b>

03:31.880 --> 03:33.710
<b>Good Luck</b>

03:32.540 --> 03:33.710
<b>Just "Good Luck"...</b>

03:33.710 --> 03:35.710
<b>Lemme try again.</b>

03:35.960 --> 03:37.920
<b>I'll keep at it till I get a good one!</b>

03:37.920 --> 03:39.250
<b>That's not how fortunes work...
I'll keep at it till I get a good one!</b>

03:39.250 --> 03:41.250
<b>That's not how fortunes work...</b>

03:42.670 --> 03:43.920
<b>What'd you get, Miki?</b>

03:44.420 --> 03:46.790
<b>Oh no, oh no, oh no...</b>

03:46.790 --> 03:47.670
<b>Huh?</b>

03:48.580 --> 03:53.790
<b>Modest Luck</b>

03:49.210 --> 03:51.580
<b>Oh, come on, "Modest Luck" is pretty tame...</b>

03:51.580 --> 03:53.420
<b>No, but look...</b>

03:53.790 --> 03:58.540
<b>Your wishes
may run
into trouble</b>

03:54.250 --> 03:57.580
<b>"Your wishes may run into trouble..."</b>

03:58.540 --> 04:00.250
<b>Shinjugamine
Girls’ School</b>

03:59.290 --> 04:03.250
<b>I just got word that the Fortissimo staff
ran into a bit of trouble...</b>

04:00.250 --> 04:02.710
<b>Hoshimori Class</b>

04:03.250 --> 04:07.130
<b>and they might have to cancel the show
they planned on having here at school.</b>

04:08.830 --> 04:11.210
<b>But I was looking forward to that!</b>

04:10.080 --> 04:13.540
<b>HS 2nd Year                                                               HS 3rd Year
Kurumi Tokiwa                                                         Asuha Kusunoki</b>

04:11.210 --> 04:13.540
<b>What kind of trouble are we talking about?</b>

04:13.790 --> 04:16.580
<b>Apparently the bus the 
concert staff were on...</b>

04:16.580 --> 04:19.580
<b>stalled out on the road after a landslide.</b>

04:19.880 --> 04:24.080
<b>And so they all had dinner while they waited it out,
but then there was a bad case of food poisoning...</b>

04:24.460 --> 04:27.000
<b>and all of them ended up 
having to go to the hospital.</b>

04:27.000 --> 04:28.880
<b>Are you serious...?</b>

04:27.000 --> 04:29.830
<b>HS 2nd Year                                                                        HS 2nd Year
Nozomi Amano                                                                 Yuri Himukai</b>

04:28.880 --> 04:31.000
<b>It's like a real-life sitcom.</b>

04:31.000 --> 04:33.340
<b>It was nothing serious thankfully,</b>

04:33.340 --> 04:36.170
<b>but it doesn't look like
they'll be back in time for the concert.</b>

04:36.460 --> 04:38.210
<b>Just like Miki's fortune...</b>

04:38.210 --> 04:39.290
<b>Wh-what?!</b>

04:39.920 --> 04:42.710
<b>I even tied it up at the shrine 
to stave off bad luck...!</b>

04:42.710 --> 04:45.330
<b>Now Miki, this is all just coincidence, yeah?</b>

04:46.330 --> 04:49.500
<b>The real problem lays in the fortunes from
Kokomi's family's shrine...</b>

04:49.500 --> 04:50.710
<b>Maybe they're cursed?</b>

04:50.710 --> 04:53.460
<b>Wha-?! N-No way!</b>

04:53.460 --> 04:57.080
<b>Right now our manager is trying to
pull together some back-up staff.</b>

04:57.380 --> 05:02.080
<b>But everyone seems to be booked up,
so it's not looking too great.</b>

05:02.540 --> 05:04.960
<b>So these two came up with a bit of an idea.</b>

05:07.710 --> 05:13.630
<b>Would you all please act as stand-in staff
and put together our concert with us?</b>

05:13.630 --> 05:15.040
<b>WHAT?!</b>

05:15.290 --> 05:17.580
<b>B-but we've never even...</b>

05:18.130 --> 05:20.960
<b>We gave it a lot of thought, 
but this is our only option...</b>

05:20.960 --> 05:24.880
<b>We don't have any special equipment
this time around, so it shouldn't be too hard.</b>

05:25.170 --> 05:26.710
<b>But still...</b>

05:30.170 --> 05:31.380
<b>Count me in!</b>

05:31.380 --> 05:35.290
<b>It's all my fault that this happened, anyway!</b>

05:35.540 --> 05:38.170
<b>This isn't your fault, Miki.</b>

05:38.170 --> 05:42.130
<b>Yeah, sorry. Maybe I went a little too far.</b>

05:42.460 --> 05:43.880
<b>I'll help too!</b>

05:43.880 --> 05:45.710
<b>And so will Kokomi, right?</b>

05:45.960 --> 05:48.040
<b>I will? O-okay.</b>

05:48.040 --> 05:50.420
<b>JH 1st Year
Hinata Minami</b>

05:48.040 --> 05:50.420
<b>It sounds kinda fun! Count me in too!</b>

05:50.420 --> 05:51.670
<b>And me!</b>

05:51.670 --> 05:53.000
<b>Me too!</b>

05:51.670 --> 05:56.040
<b>JH 1st Year
Sadone
JH 1st Year
Sakura Fujimiya</b>

05:53.000 --> 05:56.040
<b>Well, we can't just let the 
needy go unheeded, can we?</b>

05:57.380 --> 06:01.460
<b>Just checking, but does that mean
we have your permission?</b>

06:01.750 --> 06:07.000
<b>You do. These two are in a bit of a pinch,
so the school president has already given her approval.</b>

06:07.630 --> 06:09.460
<b>Well, in that case...</b>

06:10.040 --> 06:11.540
<b>I think that settles it!</b>

06:16.880 --> 06:22.040
<b>Okay, so we've been lumping everyone together
as "staff", but there are lots of jobs to be done.</b>

06:22.040 --> 06:26.290
<b>Now, I don't mean to be presumptuous,
but I'll take a managerial role.</b>

06:26.290 --> 06:28.080
<b>Oh! Miss Stage Director!</b>

06:28.080 --> 06:29.500
<b>Woohoo producer!</b>

06:29.500 --> 06:32.710
<b>HS 3rd Year
Renge Serizawa</b>

06:29.500 --> 06:33.130
<b>Oh! Make sure you produce 
me up real nice, okay?</b>

06:33.580 --> 06:35.710
<b>Maybe I should make some more spots
for cleaning staff...</b>

06:35.710 --> 06:37.880
<b>Oh, the whip of love!</b>

06:39.380 --> 06:41.460
<b>Look at that, even Misaki's here.</b>

06:40.380 --> 06:43.880
<b>HS 1st Year
Misaki</b>

06:41.460 --> 06:43.880
<b>I totally expected her to flake out on us...</b>

06:44.330 --> 06:47.630
<b>After talking with Kanon and the others
we put together a list of roles.</b>

06:47.630 --> 06:50.420
<b>First up, for costume artist 
and stylist, Nozomi.</b>

06:51.210 --> 06:54.000
<b>Get ready for the cutest outfits ever!</b>

06:54.290 --> 06:56.790
<b>Anko will be in charge of sound and
stage equipment controls.</b>

06:55.830 --> 06:59.880
<b>HS 3rd Year
Anko Tsubuzaki</b>

06:56.790 --> 07:00.790
<b>Oooh, switching out the songs,
timing up the lasers to the music!</b>

07:00.790 --> 07:03.000
<b>It's like a real life game!</b>

07:03.500 --> 07:04.920
<b>Then we have...</b>

07:05.420 --> 07:06.210
<b>Huh?</b>

07:06.210 --> 07:08.880
<b>I'll be a backup dancer!</b>

07:09.250 --> 07:12.040
<b>Oh, uhh, Urara and Kokomi will be...</b>

07:12.290 --> 07:14.080
<b>Backup dancers!</b>

07:14.080 --> 07:15.960
<b>Urara and Kokomi will be...</b>

07:15.960 --> 07:18.750
<b>Come on, Azuchi!</b>

07:20.750 --> 07:23.040
<b>But, backup dancers really 
should be professionals....</b>

07:23.040 --> 07:24.670
<b>Why not let her?
But, backup dancers really should be professionals....</b>

07:24.960 --> 07:30.420
<b>Indeed. We were still wondering what we would do
for backup dancers, but I think she'd be just fine.</b>

07:30.420 --> 07:31.790
<b>Whoopie!</b>

07:31.790 --> 07:34.580
<b>Just know that pro-level 
shows are no easy feat.</b>

07:34.580 --> 07:35.920
<b>Just what I wanted!</b>

07:35.920 --> 07:37.290
<b>Let's do this, Kokomi!</b>

07:37.290 --> 07:39.130
<b>Huh? Yeah, uhh...</b>

07:39.540 --> 07:40.920
<b>Wait, me too?</b>

07:41.540 --> 07:44.630
<b>Everyone else will help 
put together the stage.</b>

07:44.920 --> 07:48.710
<b>Alright then, let's make sure no one gets hurt,
and get this show on the road!</b>

07:48.710 --> 07:49.710
<b>Got it!</b>

07:49.710 --> 07:50.710
<b>Got it...</b>

07:52.960 --> 07:55.960
<b>Hmm... I'm no good at this...</b>

07:55.960 --> 07:58.830
<b>Hinata, it takes patience to master anything.</b>

07:58.830 --> 08:00.500
<b>Don't give up.</b>

08:01.080 --> 08:01.960
<b>Done.</b>

08:01.960 --> 08:05.630
<b>JH 2nd Year
Kaede Sendoin
Michelle Watagi</b>

08:02.670 --> 08:04.040
<b>Marvelous, Sadone!</b>

08:04.040 --> 08:05.790
<b>Wow, that's so good!</b>

08:08.380 --> 08:11.500
<b>This is nothing compared 
to our normal training!</b>

08:11.500 --> 08:12.500
<b>Piece of cake!</b>

08:12.500 --> 08:14.000
<b>But a super heavy one!</b>

08:14.250 --> 08:18.960
<b>So this cable is for lighting, 
and this here is for...</b>

08:18.960 --> 08:21.080
<b>You're really taking this 
seriously, huh Misaki!</b>

08:21.080 --> 08:23.290
<b>What? No I'm not...</b>

08:24.000 --> 08:25.790
<b>One, two, three, four!</b>

08:26.000 --> 08:27.920
<b>One, two, three, four!</b>

08:28.250 --> 08:30.920
<b>How was that...?</b>

08:31.830 --> 08:34.830
<b>Next up is something a bit harder.</b>

08:35.130 --> 08:36.500
<b>What?!</b>

08:36.500 --> 08:38.380
<b>Bring it on!</b>

08:41.040 --> 08:43.500
<b>What a big piece of machinery.</b>

08:43.920 --> 08:46.040
<b>What does this switch do?</b>

08:54.420 --> 08:58.080
<b>Sorry Kurumi, but can I ask 
you to help out Nozomi?</b>

08:58.080 --> 08:58.960
<b>Okay...</b>

08:58.960 --> 09:00.210
<b>Welcome!</b>

09:00.210 --> 09:01.420
<b>I hope I-</b>

09:02.790 --> 09:05.920
<b>Well... there WAS a dryer in there...</b>

09:08.880 --> 09:11.460
<b>I'm telling you it's supposed to be like
dun, dun duh-dun there.</b>

09:11.460 --> 09:14.500
<b>But then it switches right into
duh, duh-duh-duh afterwards!</b>

09:14.500 --> 09:16.500
<b>So you gotta put your 
knees into it like this!</b>

09:17.630 --> 09:20.790
<b>Can you not practice in the bath, please?
You're gonna get hurt...</b>

09:23.040 --> 09:24.040
<b>Here goes.</b>

09:25.790 --> 09:29.170
<b>Oh my, Shiho! You're so incredibly flexible!</b>

09:29.170 --> 09:34.380
<b>If you all do some stretches after you wash up
you'll be able to do the same thing someday.</b>

09:36.170 --> 09:38.790
<b>I can't reach any further!</b>

09:38.790 --> 09:41.130
<b>This is impossible!</b>

09:41.460 --> 09:44.460
<b>Don't go overdoing it, you three.</b>

09:44.460 --> 09:48.920
<b>Oh my, my heart is bursting from
its own stretches right now!</b>

09:48.920 --> 09:51.880
<b>Renge, I have no idea what 
that's supposed to mean.</b>

10:05.790 --> 10:07.000
<b>Come on!</b>

10:07.290 --> 10:10.040
<b>That step goes like this...</b>

10:10.040 --> 10:12.580
<b>Sorry... Urara...</b>

10:23.630 --> 10:25.460
<b>Alright, let's do this, Shiho!</b>

10:25.710 --> 10:27.380
<b>Right with you, Kanon.</b>

10:38.040 --> 10:39.500
<b>Hoshimori Class</b>

10:39.630 --> 10:46.040
<b>Okay, so, I know you're all probably tired
from your missions, the concert, and everything,</b>

10:46.460 --> 10:48.880
<b>but keep it up, you're almost there.</b>

10:51.960 --> 10:54.080
<b>Tomorrow's the day.</b>

10:54.080 --> 10:58.420
<b>We're a little behind schedule,
but I'll take safety over speed.</b>

10:58.420 --> 10:59.250
<b>Got it!</b>

11:01.500 --> 11:04.290
<b>I know you're all busy, but we've got Irous!</b>

11:04.540 --> 11:07.040
<b>Everyone on duty get down to the lab ASAP!</b>

11:07.040 --> 11:11.830
<b>Seriously? I was just getting 
ready to try on my outfit!</b>

11:13.830 --> 11:16.580
<b>Hey! Why did you have to show up now?</b>

11:16.580 --> 11:18.040
<b>Way to kill the mood!</b>

11:18.040 --> 11:19.500
<b>I don't think they care...</b>

11:24.290 --> 11:26.330
<b>We just need to take them down fast, right?</b>

11:26.330 --> 11:27.750
<b>Let's head back quick!</b>

11:29.080 --> 11:30.920
<b>If you're going for speed,</b>

11:30.920 --> 11:32.630
<b>then let us help out!</b>

11:32.630 --> 11:35.040
<b>Kano-kano? And Shihochi too?</b>

11:36.580 --> 11:37.790
<b>But why?</b>

11:38.210 --> 11:40.960
<b>We need to pay you back for all the help.</b>

11:41.210 --> 11:42.920
<b>I hope this makes up for it.</b>

11:46.460 --> 11:48.130
<b>Let's make it swift!</b>

11:48.130 --> 11:49.210
<b>R-right!</b>

11:53.630 --> 11:56.380
<b>All signs of Irous – Clear.</b>

11:56.670 --> 11:58.380
<b>Let's call off the evacuation.</b>

11:58.380 --> 11:59.630
<b>Good work, g-</b>

11:59.920 --> 12:01.170
<b>What happened?!</b>

12:01.170 --> 12:06.880
<b>Well, we got surrounded by a bunch of Irous,
and I think she sprained her ankle.</b>

12:06.880 --> 12:07.710
<b>What?!</b>

12:08.250 --> 12:10.290
<b>Heh. I'm a real klutz, huh...</b>

12:11.040 --> 12:15.000
<b>Kanon Kougami (2nd Year HS)
Birthday: August 28th
Sign: Virgo
Blood Type: AB
Measurements: 85/55/83
Height: 157cm
Weight: 43kg
Hobby: Dancing
Idol: Shiho Kunieda 
Favorite food: Dried bonito
Dislikes: Anything unappealing to the eye</b>

12:15.080 --> 12:19.040
<b>Shiho Kunieda (2nd Year HS)
Birthday: October 24th
Sign: Scorpio
Blood Type: O
Measurements: 89/62/93
Height: 161cm
Weight: 50kg
Hobby: Reading (Mysteries)
Idol: Kanon Kougami
Favorite food: Meat and potatoes
Dislikes: Fancy food</b>

12:21.500 --> 12:22.830
<b>Is everything going to be okay?</b>

12:22.830 --> 12:24.250
<b>Tomorrow is...</b>

12:25.460 --> 12:27.130
<b>I'll be fine.</b>

12:27.130 --> 12:29.500
<b>Just needs a little bandaging
and then I'll be good to go.</b>

12:29.830 --> 12:30.960
<b>But...</b>

12:31.420 --> 12:32.540
<b>Okay then.</b>

12:32.540 --> 12:35.790
<b>Tomorrow will go on as-is with no changes
to the song lineup or anything.</b>

12:35.790 --> 12:37.040
<b>That's what you want, right?</b>

12:37.040 --> 12:37.750
<b>What?!</b>

12:37.750 --> 12:39.250
<b>Shihochi...</b>

12:39.250 --> 12:43.330
<b>The two of us promised each other
that we'd be straightforward to one another.</b>

12:43.540 --> 12:45.540
<b>The good and the bad.</b>

12:46.210 --> 12:51.670
<b>So if she says she's 
fine, then I believe her.</b>

12:52.170 --> 12:53.580
<b>That's my Shiho.</b>

12:54.000 --> 12:57.540
<b>But if anything changes, 
you be sure to tell me.</b>

12:57.540 --> 12:59.210
<b>Yeah, of course.</b>

13:03.920 --> 13:07.330
<b>Are they really okay? Kanon and Shiho?</b>

13:07.500 --> 13:10.000
<b>It did seem like they were overdoing it...</b>

13:12.580 --> 13:15.380
<b>It's still a little early, but 
let's wrap things up here today.</b>

13:15.380 --> 13:17.710
<b>No one is focused on what they're doing.</b>

13:19.460 --> 13:21.790
<b>I understand that you're 
all worried about Kanon,</b>

13:21.790 --> 13:24.500
<b>but working like this will only lead to
someone else getting hurt.</b>

13:24.500 --> 13:29.960
<b>f*f Nationwide School Tour
at Shinjugamine Girls' School</b>

13:25.170 --> 13:27.040
<b>We've got 80% of the work done already.</b>

13:27.040 --> 13:29.960
<b>Let's get started early 
tomorrow and finish up.</b>

13:31.710 --> 13:33.580
<b>Okay then.</b>

13:33.960 --> 13:35.920
<b>Compress</b>

13:36.920 --> 13:37.670
<b>Ouch!</b>

13:37.670 --> 13:38.790
<b>Gimme that.</b>

13:39.250 --> 13:40.880
<b>I'll do it for you.</b>

13:40.880 --> 13:42.920
<b>You're not the best with 
this sort of stuff anyway.</b>

13:44.290 --> 13:47.630
<b>No no, this is just... You see...</b>

13:51.630 --> 13:53.460
<b>Tomorrow's the big day.</b>

13:53.460 --> 13:54.290
<b>It is.</b>

13:56.420 --> 14:02.080
<b>We've hit plenty of bumps on our way,
but everyone helped us make it this far.</b>

14:03.580 --> 14:05.250
<b>And I got you back.</b>

14:05.710 --> 14:08.290
<b>And I didn't lose you.</b>

14:08.290 --> 14:12.330
<b>That's why the two of us...</b>

14:13.040 --> 14:15.500
<b>Have been able to keep Fortissimo going.</b>

14:17.710 --> 14:19.750
<b>So we need to show them our thanks.</b>

14:20.040 --> 14:22.750
<b>That's why we made this 
place our last stop, right?</b>

14:23.380 --> 14:24.210
<b>Indeed.</b>

14:26.330 --> 14:27.750
<b>Hey, Shiho.</b>

14:27.750 --> 14:28.750
<b>Hmm?</b>

14:30.250 --> 14:33.580
<b>I know I'm not in the best 
shape to say this, but...</b>

14:34.290 --> 14:37.880
<b>I'm so excited for tomorrow's concert
I can hardly stand it!</b>

14:38.630 --> 14:40.000
<b>Me too!</b>

14:40.000 --> 14:42.630
<b>We've got a brand new song 
to reveal, after all!</b>

14:42.630 --> 14:45.330
<b>Alright, let's go over it all one last time!</b>

14:52.630 --> 14:53.920
<b>Good morning!</b>

14:53.920 --> 14:55.710
<b>Wait, huh?</b>

14:56.380 --> 14:58.830
<b>f*f Nationwide School Tour
at Shinjugamine Girls' School</b>

15:01.460 --> 15:04.080
<b>Okay. Looks like we did it.</b>

15:04.630 --> 15:07.960
<b>Oh, good morning you two. 
We just finished up here.</b>

15:08.330 --> 15:10.790
<b>Everyone's doing their final checks now.</b>

15:10.790 --> 15:12.880
<b>What? But wait, yesterday...</b>

15:12.880 --> 15:14.380
<b>Well!</b>

15:14.380 --> 15:18.000
<b>You'll be performing a brand new song, right?</b>

15:18.000 --> 15:19.960
<b>We wanted to make sure 
everything was perfect!</b>

15:19.960 --> 15:20.960
<b>You girls...</b>

15:20.960 --> 15:23.960
<b>Wait! Our new song was 
supposed to be a secret!</b>

15:25.630 --> 15:27.830
<b>So you overheard us yesterday, did you?</b>

15:27.830 --> 15:29.920
<b>Well, you see...</b>

15:30.880 --> 15:32.330
<b>Ah, who cares?</b>

15:32.330 --> 15:36.500
<b>I guess it's not a surprise anymore,
but we'll make up for it with the performance!</b>

15:36.500 --> 15:38.330
<b>I won't be beat!</b>

15:38.330 --> 15:39.880
<b>Let's show 'em, Kokomi!</b>

15:39.880 --> 15:41.880
<b>Wha-? Y-yeah.</b>

15:47.330 --> 15:49.630
<b>Woah, look at that crowd!</b>

15:49.630 --> 15:51.920
<b>What did you expect? Tickets are sold out!</b>

15:53.130 --> 15:55.670
<b>Asuha, we've got everyone in.</b>

15:55.670 --> 15:57.380
<b>The PA system is ready to go.</b>

15:57.380 --> 15:59.420
<b>Alright, let's get started then!</b>

16:04.960 --> 16:08.790
<b>We'll save our thanks for later, 
once we're all finished.</b>

16:09.250 --> 16:11.960
<b>It's time for our Shinjugamine 
Girls' School performance!</b>

16:11.960 --> 16:13.790
<b>Let's make this a hit!</b>

16:13.790 --> 16:15.080
<b>Yeah!</b>

16:19.580 --> 16:24.250
<b>Hey everyone!
Thanks for coming out to see us here today!</b>

16:24.540 --> 16:26.420
<b>We hope you'll enjoy yourselves!</b>

16:35.290 --> 16:37.710
<b>Minamo ni saku
Blooming on the water's surface</b>

16:37.710 --> 16:40.250
<b>Hana ni muketa
It's to the flowers</b>

16:40.630 --> 16:43.250
<b>Kotoba wa nigoru
I spoke with muddied words</b>

16:43.250 --> 16:45.880
<b>Ima o nakushita
As here and now slipped away</b>

16:45.880 --> 16:48.830
<b>My shadow keep in</b>

16:48.830 --> 16:51.710
<b>Broken mirror</b>

16:51.710 --> 16:54.210
<b>Mind is fallen</b>

16:54.210 --> 16:57.130
<b>Mou kikoenai
I can no longer hear</b>

16:54.920 --> 16:57.080
<b>Hoshitsuki here.</b>

16:57.130 --> 17:01.830
<b>Omoide o utau kimi no koe
Your voice singing of our memories</b>

16:58.460 --> 16:59.210
<b>Huh?</b>

16:59.500 --> 17:03.000
<b>I uhh, well... I'm sorry to say this, but...</b>

17:01.830 --> 17:04.880
<b>Negai tsudzuketa koe
The voice I wished for</b>

17:03.000 --> 17:04.250
<b>Don't tell me...</b>

17:04.250 --> 17:06.210
<b>Yup, it's just what you think.</b>

17:04.880 --> 17:06.830
<b>Kitto
I promise</b>

17:06.210 --> 17:07.500
<b>No way!</b>

17:06.830 --> 17:09.540
<b>Sagasu kara
I will seek it out</b>

17:07.830 --> 17:10.040
<b>But the show just started!</b>

17:09.920 --> 17:15.040
<b>Deeper kyoukai ni yureru
Deeper shaking on the boundaries</b>

17:10.040 --> 17:11.040
<b>Miki.</b>

17:11.580 --> 17:14.580
<b>Asuha asked me to come 
cover the lights for you...</b>

17:15.250 --> 17:20.290
<b>Ano sora wa mabushikute
The skies out there are ever so bright</b>

17:15.540 --> 17:17.540
<b>Kaede, they're in your hands now!</b>

17:17.540 --> 17:18.250
<b>Right!</b>

17:20.710 --> 17:26.210
<b>Kasanaru jibun ni
And to myself there</b>

17:21.380 --> 17:23.330
<b>Sheesh! Right when we get started!</b>

17:23.330 --> 17:25.420
<b>Let's hurry and take them 
down so we can get back!</b>

17:25.420 --> 17:26.170
<b>Okay!</b>

17:26.210 --> 17:31.210
<b>Chikai o tateteyuku
I will make this vow</b>

17:31.460 --> 17:36.500
<b>Fake out nounai ni hibiku
Fake out, it rings through my head</b>

17:36.920 --> 17:42.040
<b>Kono yume wa nandarou?
What is this dream anyway?</b>

17:42.330 --> 17:51.790
<b>Aratana mirai o tsunagu sekai
It leads to a whole new future</b>

17:51.790 --> 17:56.420
<b>Sono mukou e
Now let's go for it</b>

17:57.710 --> 18:00.710
<b>Looks like the bandages came loose
and made it worse.</b>

18:00.710 --> 18:03.420
<b>What! After you made it this far?</b>

18:04.630 --> 18:06.000
<b>What's wrong, Anko?</b>

18:06.000 --> 18:07.500
<b>What do you mean "what's wrong?"</b>

18:07.500 --> 18:09.830
<b>You take this long and 
people are gonna notice!</b>

18:10.130 --> 18:11.540
<b>We can't have that!</b>

18:11.540 --> 18:14.210
<b>The next part is the most important one!</b>

18:14.210 --> 18:16.170
<b>But, with a foot like that...</b>

18:16.170 --> 18:19.710
<b>It's fine! Just needs some ice.</b>

18:19.710 --> 18:22.420
<b>Plus, everyone's waiting for us.</b>

18:22.420 --> 18:23.710
<b>Kanon...</b>

18:24.040 --> 18:25.670
<b>We don't have time...</b>

18:26.290 --> 18:28.750
<b>Hey, Misaki, what's the big idea?</b>

18:29.580 --> 18:31.000
<b>This is your next costume, right?</b>

18:31.000 --> 18:32.080
<b>Huh?</b>

18:32.290 --> 18:33.790
<b>I'll go out in your place.</b>

18:33.790 --> 18:34.670
<b>WHAT?!</b>

18:34.670 --> 18:36.630
<b>We're just about the same height
and everything so it should be fine.</b>

18:36.630 --> 18:39.500
<b>But you'll have to do the singing.
We can stall for about a song's worth.</b>

18:39.790 --> 18:42.920
<b>Are you kidding me?
Give me back that outfit right now!</b>

18:43.670 --> 18:45.880
<b>You don't want to leave a 
gap in your show, right?</b>

18:48.170 --> 18:50.750
<b>We don't have any more time.
This is the best plan of action.</b>

18:53.290 --> 18:55.500
<b>If you mess up even a step out there,</b>

18:55.750 --> 18:58.130
<b>I will never forgive you.</b>

18:59.170 --> 19:00.500
<b>So be it.</b>

19:01.000 --> 19:02.500
<b>We're back!</b>

19:02.920 --> 19:04.330
<b>Good work, girls.</b>

19:04.330 --> 19:06.040
<b>How's the concert going?</b>

19:06.040 --> 19:07.500
<b>It's about to hit its big climax.</b>

19:07.500 --> 19:09.420
<b>The place is really pumping!</b>

19:09.710 --> 19:10.540
<b>Huh?</b>

19:11.080 --> 19:12.880
<b>But that's...</b>

19:13.040 --> 19:14.580
<b>Koi wa cat cat
Love is a cat cat</b>

19:14.580 --> 19:16.500
<b>Wagamama itte
Always so selfish</b>

19:16.500 --> 19:18.210
<b>Aitai dake
I just want to see you</b>

19:18.210 --> 19:21.210
<b>Watashi wa kimagure nano
I'm just a little whimsical</b>

19:21.210 --> 19:22.040
<b>Kyun kyun
My heart is thumping</b>

19:22.040 --> 19:25.880
<b>Kawaiku sotte amaeru nante
Just acting cute and so cuddly</b>

19:25.880 --> 19:28.040
<b>Niawanain deshou!
Wouldn't be like me would it!</b>

19:28.040 --> 19:29.580
<b>Demo ne cat cat
But cat cat</b>

19:29.580 --> 19:32.380
<b>Sunao na heart ii kamo
Being true to your heart is best</b>

19:32.380 --> 19:36.210
<b>Mou kokoro wa kimi dake nano
My heart is yours alone</b>

19:36.210 --> 19:37.040
<b>Chu chu
Kiss kiss</b>

19:37.040 --> 19:39.000
<b>Kore kara isshou
We'll be together</b>

19:39.000 --> 19:40.750
<b>Itsudemo sou yo
Always and forever</b>

19:40.750 --> 19:43.710
<b>Watashi o tokimekasete
Make my heart flutter</b>

19:43.710 --> 19:51.210
<b>Mune no oku ni daki yosete!
Pull me in close to your chest!</b>

20:01.880 --> 20:03.710
<b>That was incredible, Misaki!</b>

20:04.630 --> 20:07.880
<b>So you were a Fortissimo 
fan all along, huh, Misaki?</b>

20:09.830 --> 20:11.540
<b>Looks like you're finished.</b>

20:12.210 --> 20:14.210
<b>Is your foot all right?</b>

20:14.420 --> 20:15.790
<b>It's fine.</b>

20:28.170 --> 20:31.290
<b>Now don't take your eyes off of us.</b>

20:34.040 --> 20:38.040
<b>It feels like we only just started,
but next up is our last song.</b>

20:38.380 --> 20:40.880
<b>This brand new song is for...</b>

20:41.420 --> 20:43.830
<b>The ones who always cheer us on.</b>

20:44.380 --> 20:47.630
<b>It's a song for our wonderful 
friends and companions.</b>

20:48.080 --> 20:50.920
<b>Here is, "GRAVITY"!</b>

20:53.330 --> 20:59.750
<b>Hikiyoseau you ni tadoritsuita basho wa
The place I wound up, as if drawn to it</b>

20:59.750 --> 21:05.710
<b>Yureru omoi mo michibiite kureta
Brought to me trembling emotions</b>

21:06.130 --> 21:12.580
<b>Sorezore kakaeteru tsuyosa to yasashisa wa
Each with its own strength and kindness</b>

21:12.580 --> 21:18.420
<b>Kakegae no nai nakama no wa ni naru
They became my most treasured group of friends</b>

21:18.880 --> 21:31.330
<b>Kasanatta michi no saki e to yorisotte senaka o oshite
Draw close and urge me forward down the overlapping road</b>

21:31.710 --> 21:37.210
<b>Donna mirai ga matteiru to shitemo
No matter what sort of future awaits</b>

21:37.210 --> 21:43.170
<b>Deatta toki kara tsumui dekita
Things have been spinning since we first met</b>

21:43.380 --> 21:50.210
<b>Omoide wa kotonoha wa ima demo koko ni aru
Those memories, those words, are still here</b>

21:50.210 --> 21:55.790
<b>Owaranai story wasurenai yo
I won't forget this never ending story</b>

21:55.790 --> 21:58.920
<b>Arigatou tsutaeyou
Let's say our thanks</b>

21:58.920 --> 22:09.710
<b>Kore kara mo tomo ni susumou
And continue onwards together</b>

22:28.790 --> 22:30.790
<b>Wow, that was fun!</b>

22:30.790 --> 22:33.670
<b>Mhmm, what an amazing concert.</b>

22:34.210 --> 22:35.580
<b>How's your foot?</b>

22:35.580 --> 22:37.040
<b>It's fine.</b>

22:37.040 --> 22:39.500
<b>I had so much fun I forgot I even hurt it.</b>

22:42.290 --> 22:44.460
<b>They saved us yet again, huh.</b>

22:44.460 --> 22:45.830
<b>It's fine!</b>

22:45.830 --> 22:49.080
<b>I bet we'll be saving 
them someday soon enough.</b>

22:49.080 --> 22:51.170
<b>That's what friends are for, right?</b>

22:52.000 --> 22:53.000
<b>I guess you're right.</b>

22:53.000 --> 22:54.920
<b>Ah! There you are!</b>

22:54.920 --> 22:57.540
<b>Kanokano! Shihochi!</b>

22:59.290 --> 23:00.960
<b>That concert was fantastic!</b>

23:00.960 --> 23:03.080
<b>That last song blew me away!</b>

23:03.080 --> 23:04.920
<b>I think I even cried a little...</b>

23:04.920 --> 23:06.540
<b>I had so much fun!</b>

23:06.540 --> 23:07.580
<b>Me too!</b>

23:07.580 --> 23:08.460
<b>You two were marvelous.</b>

23:08.460 --> 23:09.380
<b>You were so cool.
You two were marvelous.</b>

23:09.380 --> 23:10.040
<b>You were so cool.</b>

23:13.670 --> 23:16.790
<b>Thank you all for coming out today!</b>

23:16.790 --> 23:19.000
<b>Let us show our thanks with a song.</b>

23:19.500 --> 23:23.500
<b>Here's a special encore just for our friends!</b>

23:23.830 --> 23:25.040
<b>Enjoy!</b>

23:26.750 --> 23:29.080
<b>Nozomi! What are you doing skipping training?</b>

23:29.080 --> 23:30.750
<b>I said I'd pass, didn't I?</b>

23:30.750 --> 23:32.210
<b>You think that works?</b>

23:32.210 --> 23:34.210
<b>We're the Hoshimori class, you know!</b>

23:34.210 --> 23:36.630
<b>Next time: "The Meaning of the Iris"!</b>

23:36.040 --> 23:41.000
<b>Next Episode
The Meaning of the Iris
Leave it to me! Woof!</b>

23:36.630 --> 23:40.460
<b>I know... I'll never be as strong as Yuri...</b>
